Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Revenue-tied Google Search, Meta Ads, and LinkedIn campaigns.\\n  - [`/services/seo-growth`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Technical SEO moats, local Map Pack dominance, and programmatic keyword clusters.\\n  - [`/services/analytics`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): GA4, Meta CAPI, server-side tracking, and WhatsApp API automation.\\n\\n- **Universal Service & Case Study Resolver (`resolveService` & `resolveCaseStudy`)**:\\n  - Supports direct matching, partial alias matching, and auto-generated rich fallbacks for any custom URL with zero broken pages or 404 errors.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. 📖 Complete Blog Insights & Interactive Engagement\\n- **1-Click Social Media Share**:\\n  - 📋 **Copy Article Link**: Instant clipboard copy with green confirmation banner.\\n  - 💬 **WhatsApp Share**: Direct pre-filled WhatsApp share \n<truncated 1243 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with inner pages and blog engagement details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
