{"step_index":235,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:01:03Z","content":"Aapke bataye gaye sabhi issues fix aur upgrade kar diye gaye hain! 🎉\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 1. Services & Work Ke Saare Inner Pages Ab Smoothly Open Ho Rahe Hain:\n\nHumne ek intelligent `resolveService` aur `resolveCaseStudy` routing engine build kiya hai, jisse saare direct URLs aur aliases bina kisi 404 error ke khulte hain:\n\n- **Website Design**: [`/services/website-design`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(Sub-second React web apps, high-converting CRO landing pages, interactive calculators)*\n- **Social Media Marketing**: [`/services/social-media-marketing`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(Content pillars, viral UGC Reels, community engagement)*\n- **Graphic Design**: [`/services/graphic-design`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(Performance ad creatives, motion graphics, brand identity systems)*\n- **Performance Ads**: [`/services/performance-ads`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(Google & Meta revenue-tied campaigns)*\n- **Technical SEO**: [`/services/seo-growth`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(Core Web Vitals, local Map Pack, keyword clusters)*\n- **Analytics & Automation**: [`/services/analytics`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx) *(GA4, Meta CAPI, WhatsApp API automations)*\n- **Work / Case Studies**: [`/work/veloura-organics-d2c-skincare`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx), [`/work/skillcraft-academy-edtech`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx), [`/work/zentura-cloud-b2b-saas`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx), [`/work/apex-prime-realty-luxury-real-estate`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx)\n\n---\n\n### 📝 2. Blog Ke Under Social Media Share, Like, Comment Aur Recent Blogs:\n\nHar blog post ke andar ab full interactive system active hai:\n1. **1-Click Social Media Share Row**:\n   - 📋 **Copy Link**: 1-click me URL copy hota hai aur instant confirmation aati hai.\n   - 💬 **WhatsApp Share**: Direct WhatsApp open hoke post share hoti hai.\n   - 💼 **LinkedIn Share**: Direct LinkedIn share preview khulta hai.\n   - 🐦 **Twitter / X Share**: Direct tweet compose window open hoti hai.\n2. **❤️ Live Interactive Like Button**:\n   - Click karne par instant heart fill animation aur count badhta hai (localStorage + backend sync ke sath).\n3. **💬 Live Community Discussion & Comments Stream**:\n   - Real-time comment submission box + live comments stream with avatar initials aur timestamp.\n4. **📚 \"Recent Growth Playbooks\" Section**:\n   - Blog article ke neeche recent recommended articles ki grid di gayi hai, jisme category tag, read time, date aur **\"Read Guide\"** button hai.\n\n---\n\n### 📦 3. Production Build & Verification:\n- **Build Status**: `vite build` completed with **0 errors** (1590 modules transformed successfully).\n- **Documentation**: Details check karne ke liye aap updated [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/ashis/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc/walkthrough.md) dekh sakte hain!"}
