{"step_index":313,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:38:07Z","thinking":"**Evaluating Frontend Delivery**\n\nThe frontend is now serving with all requested features. I'm satisfied with the integration of `Playfair Display`, `Manrope`, and `DM Mono`. The warm paper and ink color palette and genuine editorial layout are implemented, and all services are running.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough documenting the restoration of the authentic human editorial agency UI/UX design with warm paper and ink aesthetics, Playfair Display typography, functional inner service and case study pages, interactive blog engagement, and MCP backend integration.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Restoring the Authentic Human Editorial UI/UX Design\\n\\nWe have restored the **authentic, human, editorial agency design** that makes **Get Into Feed** look like an independent, high-craft digital growth studio rather than a generic dark-mode AI template.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎨 Design System: Authentic Human Craft\\n\\n- **Color Palette**:\\n  - **Warm Paper Canvas**: `--paper: #fbfaf5`, `--cream: #f0efe6`, `--white: #fffefa`\\n  - **Deep Forest Ink**: `--ink: #123b35`, `--deep: #092a26`, `--sage: #d9eddc`\\n  - **Editorial Accents**: Vibrant Coral (`--coral: #f15f46`), Sunlit Honey (`--yellow: #f7c94c`), and Subtle Border Lines (`--line: rgba(18,59,53,.16)`).\\n- **Typography Pairing**:\\n  - **Playfair Display**: Editorial serif for headlines, giving the agency an authoritative, thoughtful voice.\\n  - **Manrope**: Humanist geometric sans-serif for clear, readable body copy and UI elements.\\n  - **DM Mono**: Clean data tags, kicker labels, and metrics.\\n- **Visual Personality**:\\n  - Warm hero section with photography overlay and editorial copywriting.\\n  - Distinctive `GF` geometric monogram graphic marks.\\n  - Three-tiered case study cards with colored card backgrounds (`Ink`, `Coral`, `Forest Green`).\\n  - Warm yellow stat strip and clean client testimonials.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🛠️ Fully Working Inner Pages & Routing\\n\\nAll sub-pages load seamlessly with zero 404 errors:\\n\\n### 1. Services Sub-Pages\\n- [`/services/website-design`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Website Design & Web Experiences\\n- [`/services/social-media-marketing`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Social Media Marketing & Content\\n- [`/services/graphic-design`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Graphic Design & Visual Systems\\n- [`/services/paid-media`](file:///c:/Users/ashis/OneDrive/Documents/Get%20into%20feed/frontend/src/DetailPages.jsx): Paid Media & Performance \n<truncated 1469 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough to document restoration of authentic editorial UI/UX\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
