{"step_index":315,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T10:38:18Z","content":"Aapka **original, authentic human UI/UX designer wala design** wapas restore kar diya gaya hai! 🎨✨\n\nGeneric AI neon dark-mode look ko hata kar wahi **original editorial agency look** restore kiya gaya hai jo natural, elegant aur authentic lagta hai:\n\n---\n\n### 🏛️ Wapas Restore Huye Design Elements:\n1. **Warm Paper & Deep Forest Ink Aesthetic**:\n   - Natural warm background (`#fbfaf5` / `#f0efe6`)\n   - Deep Forest Ink typography (`#123b35`), Sage Green accents (`#d9eddc`), Vibrant Coral (`#f15f46`), aur Sunlit Honey yellow strip.\n2. **Editorial Typography (High Human Craft)**:\n   - **Playfair Display**: Sophisticated editorial serif headings\n   - **Manrope**: Clean humanist body typography\n   - **DM Mono**: Data kickers, tags, aur metrics\n3. **Authentic Agency Visuals & Monograms**:\n   - Hero section with photography overlay & clear copywriting\n   - Custom `GF` geometric graphic marks\n   - 3-tier colored case study cards (`Ink`, `Coral`, `Forest Green`)\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Localhost Par Abhi Live Preview Dekhein:\n\nAap apne browser me in links par click karke wahi original design check kar sakte hain:\n\n1. **Homepage (Original Human Agency Look)**:\n   👉 **[http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)**\n\n2. **Services Ke Saare Sub-Pages (Ab Sab Smoothly Khul Rahe Hain)**:\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/website-design](http://localhost:5173/services/website-design)** *(Website Design)*\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/social-media-marketing](http://localhost:5173/services/social-media-marketing)** *(Social Media Marketing)*\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/graphic-design](http://localhost:5173/services/graphic-design)** *(Graphic Design)*\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/paid-media](http://localhost:5173/services/paid-media)** *(Paid Media)*\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/seo-growth](http://localhost:5173/services/seo-growth)** *(SEO Growth)*\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/services/analytics](http://localhost:5173/services/analytics)** *(Analytics)*\n\n3. **Work / Case Studies**:\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/work/local-education-brand](http://localhost:5173/work/local-education-brand)**\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/work/d2c-wellness-store](http://localhost:5173/work/d2c-wellness-store)**\n   - 👉 **[http://localhost:5173/work/b2b-service-company](http://localhost:5173/work/b2b-service-company)**\n\n4. **Blog Insights (With